<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait Commercial Bank says net up 117pct.</title>
<headline>Kuwait Commercial Bank says net up 117pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit		     17.349	  8.001</p>
<p> Net interest income	  16.881	 10.460</p>
<p> Provisions			1.032	  1.145</p>
<p> Cash dividend		  10.636	  0.000</p>
<p> Bonus shares		    0.000	  6.958</p>
<p>Full name: Commercial Bank of Kuwait.</p>
<p>Note: The bank's general assembly accepted the resignation the board of directors including chairman Hamad al-Hamad. Board members will keep their posts until a new board is elected. The assembly authorised the board to issue bonds with a maximum value of 20 million dinars.</p>
<p>Kuwait newsroom, Inal Ersan +965-243-1920</p>
</text>
